Cached temperature probe with request coalescing ("single flight")
Practice problem — Verkada 1st-screening shape (Part 1 concurrency / Part 2 data structure)
Format: one C file, cc -std=c11 -O2 -Wall -Wextra -pthread. Part 1 then Part 2 on the same code.

